#. module: stock_account_multicompany_ux
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/stock_account_multicompany_ux/models/stock_warehouse.py:0
msgid ""
"%(branch)s is a branch of %(root)s, which shares the stock valuation of "
"%(count)s product categories to its branches (for example, %(categories)s). "
"That setup is meant for stock on the parent company only, so a branch cannot"
" have a warehouse. Disable 'Shared Stock Valuation to Branches' on those "
"categories first."
msgstr ""

#. module: stock_account_multicompany_ux
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/stock_account_multicompany_ux/models/product_category.py:0
msgid ""
"'Shared Stock Valuation to Branches' is meant for stock on the parent "
"company and branches that only invoice. These branches of %(root)s have "
"active warehouses: %(branches)s. Their stock would be valued at each "
"branch's own cost, so the valuation cannot be shared."
msgstr ""

